# Vercel CLI defaults to respecting the repo's .gitignore, which deliberately excludes
# large binaries (*.apk, *.mp4) from git. Those same files are real deployment assets
# here (the site's download link and embedded video), so this file overrides that for
# THIS deploy only — keep it in sync if .gitignore's ignore patterns change.
!assets/*.apk
!assets/*.mp4
